WEBVTT

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:54.300
Seira!

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:05.200
Mikeru's dimension disappeared.

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:08.430
Seira set us free.

00:02:09.570 --> 00:02:11.120
Idol Debut

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:29.820
You're really early, Masahiro.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.390
Didn't we promise to meet at 3 o'clock?

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:34.630
What is it, only a little bit past 2?

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:36.720
I could ask you the same thing.

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:40.120
But I'm happy.

00:02:40.670 --> 00:02:42.540
I get to meet you an hour earlier, Rina-chan.

00:02:43.210 --> 00:02:44.520
The weather is nice.

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:45.570
Yeah.

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:52.670
Excuse me, young lady!

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:57.360
We're looking for possible candidates for the show "Idol Debut."

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:59.570
Would you like to audition to be on the show?

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:00.650
Eh?

00:03:02.050 --> 00:03:05.810
"Idol Debut" is looking for the next big star?

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:08.600
I sense that you're a top candidate to becoming an idol.

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:10.590
Why don't you come visit us in our studio and try out?

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:11.220
Oh my.

00:03:11.720 --> 00:03:14.960
Where have I seen her before?

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:16.560
You know her, Rina-chan?

00:03:16.970 --> 00:03:18.160
Oh, no. I must be imagining things.

00:03:18.770 --> 00:03:21.020
Since we're so early, let's go to the seating area.

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:22.080
Alright.

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:23.770
Oh, excuse me.

00:03:24.380 --> 00:03:26.970
Would you be willing to participate in the show "Idol Debut?"

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:29.940
I'm sorry, but I have no interest in becoming an idol.

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:33.260
That's a pity! You're so cute!

00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:35.620
Why don't you at least take a look at this?

00:03:36.590 --> 00:03:37.450
Masahiro.

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:41.080
I'm sorry, but she's my exclusive idol.

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:42.520
Let me return this to you.

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:44.540
"My exclusive idol?"

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:46.620
Let's go, Rina-chan.

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:48.420
Uhh...

00:04:04.150 --> 00:04:07.870
It's so nice that Rina is on a date with Hamasaki-san right now.

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:10.710
She really seemed to be looking forward to today.

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:13.990
She left way before the time that she arranged to met with him.

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:16.290
I'm so jealous!

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:19.310
By the way, where are they going for this date?

00:04:19.740 --> 00:04:20.840
You don't know?

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:22.760
No one told me!{I didn't hear about it!} Where is it?

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:25.390
The open-air live comedy show!

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:27.990
The open-air live comedy show!?

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:32.860
Yeah! The weather's really nice.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:37.850
That's nice and all, but couldn't they go somewhere more romantic?

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:43.040
Isn't it wonderful to laugh{ be laughing out loud} with the person{ that} you love?

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:47.930
Oh well. As long as the two of them enjoy it, I don't care.

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:52.520
Over the past few days, there was a door-to-door salesperson that kept trying to sell me things.

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:53.610
Oh yeah?

00:04:53.610 --> 00:04:56.880
While I was listening to her sales pitch, she suddenly splashed me with some expensive perfume.

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:58.580
That's not good!

00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:02.850
She had already paid a lot for it, so it would have been a shame to let the perfume go to waste.

00:05:02.850 --> 00:05:05.010
But after I put some on, I smelled nothing.

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:06.000
What?

00:05:06.310 --> 00:05:09.380
After looking it over{examining it}, it turned out it was only filled with water!

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:11.430
That's really expensive water.

00:05:11.430 --> 00:05:12.850
But that's perfume for you!

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:14.070
Give me a break!

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.300
Thanks for listening!

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:34.280
I laughed so much that my stomach hurts.

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:37.300
I'm glad that it made you happy.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:39.530
Yeah! It was amazing.

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:41.380
Your smile is amazing, too.

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:48.490
It's weird, but when you smile, I can be happy just with that.

00:05:49.350 --> 00:05:51.420
I should be thanking the performers instead.

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:55.320
Do I normally have such a bland look on my face?

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:58.190
No, I didn't mean it like that.

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:02.490
Sometimes, I feel like the distance between us is getting bigger.

00:06:03.140 --> 00:06:05.100
Our distance is getting bigger?

00:06:05.980 --> 00:06:07.020
I don't know why.

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:14.700
About that scout from earlier, I'm sorry for not having talked with you first.

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:15.110
Eh?

00:06:16.010 --> 00:06:21.580
I felt that if you really did become an idol, you'd be even farther away from me.

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:24.440
You should know this, Masahiro.

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:25.200
Eh?

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:27.930
I'm only interested in comedy.

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:31.290
I've never thought about being an idol.

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:32.750
I see. I'm glad.

00:06:33.020 --> 00:06:33.540
Yeah!

00:06:35.930 --> 00:06:41.450
Now that I think about it, I don't really know much about you, Rina-chan.

00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:44.310
I don't know your birthday or your blood type.

00:06:44.720 --> 00:06:46.000
I don't know where you come from.

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:48.120
Is that really important?

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:49.790
Rina-chan?

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:52.840
I guess you're right.

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:56.900
The sunset on the sea is so beautiful, so that should be enough.

00:07:05.630 --> 00:07:06.590
And then? And then?

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:08.890
I laughed for the entire act!

00:07:09.520 --> 00:07:10.400
What happened after that?

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:14.120
The next act was a two-person act, and it was out of this world!

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:14.710
Then what?

00:07:15.090 --> 00:07:18.690
The husband and wife comedy act made me laugh until I cried!

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:21.380
Ahh! That's enough, Rina!

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:24.730
I'm not asking about the {damn }comedy acts!

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:29.060
I want to know how the date with Hamasaki-san went.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:32.050
Yeah! What happened after the {live performance}skits?

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:33.340
Did you go watch a movie?

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:34.380
Nope.

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:37.400
Then what did the two of you do?

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:40.600
We went to look at the ocean.

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:45.130
Yeah! Watching sunsets over the sea is really romantic.

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:46.700
What happened next?

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:48.570
I went home after that.

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:55.670
Rina, did something happen between you and Hamasaki-san?

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:57.450
Nope. Nothing happened.

00:07:58.240 --> 00:07:59.590
I don't think anything will happen after that.

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:00.400
Eh?

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:07.250
Hey, Rina. What do you mean by that?

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:11.220
Have you forgotten that we're mermaids?

00:08:12.610 --> 00:08:14.710
Masahiro isn't one of us.

00:08:21.130 --> 00:08:22.490
Yeah, she's right.

00:08:22.490 --> 00:08:27.130
If you reveal that you're mermaids, you'll turn into sea foam.

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:30.370
Please be careful when you make friends on the surface.

00:08:31.230 --> 00:08:33.280
We know that. Right, Lucia?

00:08:35.220 --> 00:08:35.620
But...

00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:37.130
What's wrong?

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:38.440
Lucia-san?

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:44.450
What if Rina's feelings for Hamasaki-san are deeper than we think?

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:50.670
The more in love you are, the more you suffer.

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:16.430
Masahiro...

00:10:33.060 --> 00:10:34.820
Why did I fall in love with you?

00:10:35.810 --> 00:10:40.570
If I knew that it would hurt this much, I wouldn't have fallen in love with you.

00:10:41.560 --> 00:10:43.450
Why do I love you?

00:11:07.080 --> 00:11:11.000
How nice! I want to become an idol!

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:15.970
Presented by Licca and Wasurenai-Fansubs

00:11:25.880 --> 00:11:26.870
Delicious!

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:30.470
Oh! "Idol Debut" is coming up. Let's watch it.

00:11:31.240 --> 00:11:32.280
What's that?

00:11:32.800 --> 00:11:36.990
Haven't you heard? If you win{you do well in that show}, you become{can become} an idol.

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:38.650
It's a really popular show!

00:11:38.650 --> 00:11:40.880
Ahh. An idol, huh?

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:45.170
If I could live another life, I'd want to become an idol.

00:11:45.820 --> 00:11:47.850
I'd wear so many pieces of beautiful clothing.

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:50.690
A professional would do my makeup.

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:51.920
It'd be wonderful.

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:54.720
Unacceptable! Nothing good comes with being in the entertainment industry.

00:11:55.030 --> 00:11:58.390
Hanon-san, I think you should stick to watching television.

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:02.420
Welcome! This showing of the popular "Idol Debut" is about to start!

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:07.790
Hey. Why is everyone is watching "Idol Debut" in my room?

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:06.500
Let's introduce the lovely young ladies!

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:08.920
Even Hippo is here.

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:12.680
That's because if we're going to watch television, we might as well watch it...

00:12:12.680 --> 00:12:16.080
...on the newest plasma TV that you purchased with your secret stash of money.

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:17.370
Isn't it{that } obvious?

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:18.880
Let's begin!

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:24.130
Contestant number 1! Here comes the lively, smiling, and cute Alala-chan!

00:12:24.480 --> 00:12:27.770
Hello! How is everyone doing?

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:31.610
Everyone, please enjoy the song that I'm going to sing!

00:12:29.650 --> 00:12:31.580
Wasn't she from back then...

00:12:32.240 --> 00:12:34.240
What about that girl, Rina?

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:39.470
Well, Hamasaki and I saw her when she was being recruited by a scout.

00:12:49.070 --> 00:12:50.640
She doesn't seem like much.

00:12:50.640 --> 00:12:52.760
You think so? I think she's quite cute.

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:56.140
Oh no. I don't think she's much to look at.

00:12:56.570 --> 00:12:58.780
I want to be an idol!

00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:00.270
Alala-chan!

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:02.110
She's so wonderful!

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:04.440
Alala-chan, I love you!

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:07.640
What's wrong with you, Hippo?

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:08.900
Who knows?

00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:11.280
Incredible! I love her!

00:13:15.990 --> 00:13:19.350
Look, it's that girl who's been on television recently.

00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:20.970
It looks like she's going to debut!

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:23.930
No way. There's no way her CD's going to sell.

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:25.520
Let's get to school.

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:28.720
I think she's going to just disappear.

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:32.350
I somehow feel that I've seen her before.

00:13:32.980 --> 00:13:34.000
Is it my imagination?

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:40.490
Rina-chan really does want to be an idol.

00:13:43.030 --> 00:13:46.170
Look at this! It's my stage outfit!

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:49.610
The manager of the production company had it specially made for me.

00:13:49.610 --> 00:13:50.960
Isn't it wonderful?

00:13:51.210 --> 00:13:53.490
Ah. It's a nice outfit.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:55.220
It really suits you.

00:13:55.220 --> 00:13:56.420
You think so?

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:59.750
Let me give you this microphone as a present.

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:03.430
Wow! How cute!

00:14:03.430 --> 00:14:07.350
When you sing at the concert with this microphone, something good will definitely happen.

00:14:07.350 --> 00:14:08.920
Thank you!

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:11.360
Hot! Hot! Hot! Hot!

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:17.330
I'm sorry for asking you to come to the aquarium all of a sudden.

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:20.010
It's okay, I wasn't doing anything.

00:14:22.060 --> 00:14:24.560
It's that girl who's debuting as an idol.

00:14:24.990 --> 00:14:28.070
I came here because she's holding her debut concert here.

00:14:28.710 --> 00:14:30.560
Why did you bring me here?

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:35.380
I figure that maybe you could have had your debut concert here.

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:36.070
Eh?

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:42.020
I saw your face when you were looking at her poster.

00:14:42.630 --> 00:14:44.350
O-Oh no, it's not...

00:14:44.350 --> 00:14:49.010
If we go to the debut concert, we might {even }run into the scout from before.

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:53.430
I'll ask him to debut you as an idol, Rina-chan.

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:58.430
It was because of my selfishness that I refused him on your behalf. I'm sorry.

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:02.390
I have no right to take away your dreams.

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:05.120
No, it's not like that, Masahiro!

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:06.310
Let's go, Rina-chan!

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:08.030
M-Masahiro!

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:11.480
Oh, yeah! Alala!

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:14.940
Hello, everyone!

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:17.960
Hello!

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:19.850
I'm going to do my best and sing for everyone!

00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:51.450
I had no idea she was this popular.

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:53.180
Alala-chan...

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:53.720
Eh?

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:55.620
Alala-chan is so wonderful!

00:15:55.970 --> 00:15:57.490
What's with you all of a sudden?

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:00.010
Now that I think about it...

00:16:00.010 --> 00:16:03.280
Hippo started acting strange when he heard her song, too.

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:07.450
If they're both acting weird, something's definitely going on.

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:11.500
That light...

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:18.580
Masahiro! Hang on!

00:16:21.570 --> 00:16:22.430
Alala.

00:16:22.430 --> 00:16:23.170
Huh?

00:16:23.510 --> 00:16:25.520
A Mermaid Princess is nearby.

00:16:25.970 --> 00:16:30.200
I got that microphone from Mikeru-sama. It already has your ball of light installed in it.

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:34.800
It'll give you a signal when you're singing if a Mermaid Princess is nearby.

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:39.220
I see. So that's why the microphone is glittering all of a sudden.

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:42.850
Oh my! The microphone disappeared.

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:46.850
That's because you don't need it any more.

00:16:46.850 --> 00:16:51.470
Now, use your{ regular} song and get that Mermaid Princess!

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:54.940
Okay, Alala will really be singing now!

00:16:57.180 --> 00:17:01.140
The Super Idol of the new era, Alala-chan, is here!

00:17:01.890 --> 00:17:03.170
I see now.

00:17:08.910 --> 00:17:10.540
Green Pearl Voice!

00:17:12.650 --> 00:17:14.030
This concert is over!

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:17.120
Welcome, Mermaid Princess.

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:20.020
This time, you'll become my fan!

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:38.180
It's that really unbearable{uncomfortable} song.

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:39.020
It gives me the chills!

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:32.350
The feelings of sadness and suffering are gone.

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:34.000
Masahiro is...

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:37.450
Huh? Masahiro... who is he...

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:54.500
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:18:58.040 --> 00:19:00.000
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:03.060
Rina, are you okay?

00:19:03.060 --> 00:19:04.350
Hang in there!

00:19:04.350 --> 00:19:05.950
Lucia! Hanon!

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:01.520
All right, let's go!

00:20:01.940 --> 00:20:04.940
Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:36.080
This isn't your concert!

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:52.330
I've never heard of anyone just barging in and singing!

00:21:09.650 --> 00:21:12.650
My debut concert is ruined!

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:20.400
Love Shower Pitch!

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:23.460
Meanie! Meanie!

00:21:23.960 --> 00:21:25.380
How about an encore?

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:28.710
Ahh! This was my concert!

00:21:28.710 --> 00:21:31.490
I don't care! I'm going to be angry!

00:21:34.420 --> 00:21:39.150
To tell you the truth, I didn't really want you to become an idol.

00:21:40.090 --> 00:21:43.790
I didn't want us to become separated even more.

00:21:45.170 --> 00:21:46.020
Masahiro.

00:21:49.720 --> 00:21:51.610
I don't know what's going to happen from here on out.

00:21:52.560 --> 00:21:55.370
But I'm really happy when I'm with you.

00:21:56.120 --> 00:21:59.380
I want to be with you forever.

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:01.410
Rina-chan.

00:23:51.210 --> 00:23:53.420
Why {in the hell }do you always mess up at the most critical time?

00:23:53.420 --> 00:23:54.270
You're so clumsy, Mimi!

00:23:54.270 --> 00:23:57.900
You too, Sister Sheshe! Didn't you go off pitch on the song just now?

00:23:57.900 --> 00:23:59.050
You're so careless, Sheshe!

00:23:59.050 --> 00:24:00.110
You're annoying!

00:24:00.110 --> 00:24:01.940
Your stupid horns on your head are so useless!

00:24:01.940 --> 00:24:04.570
You too! Your butterfly hairclip so' doesn't suit you!

00:24:01.940 --> 00:24:04.570
You too! Your butterfly hairclip so' doesn't suit you!

00:24:04.570 --> 00:24:05.700
How dare you insult your elder sister!

00:24:05.900 --> 00:24:07.160
We're splitting up!

00:24:07.160 --> 00:24:08.300
That's right!

00:24:08.300 --> 00:24:09.790
That's what I wanted in the first place!

00:24:09.790 --> 00:24:11.550
Hmmph!

00:24:12.240 --> 00:24:14.970
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch Pure:

00:24:15.190 --> 00:24:16.520
Breakup of the Sisters.

00:24:16.520 --> 00:24:19.450
I really hate you, Sister Sheshe!
